WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,620 --> 00:00:01,620
Sister Meng

2
00:00:01,620 --> 00:00:03,620
This Jian Tong volunteered to our public relations department.

3
00:00:03,620 --> 00:00:04,620
Just a bunch of trouble

4
00:00:04,620 --> 00:00:06,620
He has no appearance or figure

5
00:00:06,620 --> 00:00:07,620
Dressed all day long

6
00:00:07,620 --> 00:00:09,620
