13
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:28,150
No no

14
00:00:28,150 --> 00:00:29,150
Since Sister Meng is optimistic about him,

15
00:00:29,150 --> 00:00:31,150
Then I'll just spend more time teaching him.

16
00:00:34,300 --> 00:00:35,300
This silly woman

17
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:38,300
Finally, I know it’s okay to feel sorry for myself

18
00:00:38,300 --> 00:00:39,300
I still know I’m tired

19
00:00:39,300 --> 00:00:40,300
There is still something to ask for

20
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:46,220
wait a moment
